487
00:27:47,266 --> 00:27:51,811
Este foarte gustos.

488
00:27:51,811 --> 00:27:58,044
とても + いA = foarte [adjectiv i]
おいしい (delicios) ↔ まずい (neplăcut la gust)

489
00:27:58,067 --> 00:28:01,021
Test de ascultare

490
00:28:01,021 --> 00:28:04,454
Peștele este dulce.

491
00:28:04,454 --> 00:28:09,157
いA + ですね = Este [adjectiv i], nu-i așa?
甘(あま)い (dulce) ↔ 辛(から)い (picant)

492
00:28:09,181 --> 00:28:11,551
Test de ascultare

493
00:28:11,551 --> 00:28:14,251
Chiar așa.

494
00:28:14,251 --> 00:28:17,989
本当(ほんとう)ですね = Adevărat, nu-i așa?
本当(ほんとう) = adevăr, realitate

495
00:28:18,013 --> 00:28:21,479
