542
00:31:40,893 --> 00:31:44,926
Da, abia aștept.

543
00:31:44,926 --> 00:31:50,459
楽(たの)しみ = abia aștept / distracție plăcută

544
00:31:50,482 --> 00:31:53,516
Test de ascultare

545
00:31:53,516 --> 00:31:57,049
Uite, a venit!

546
00:32:01,912 --> 00:32:05,910
Test de ascultare

547
00:32:05,910 --> 00:32:10,643
Uau, bolul strălucește!

548
00:32:10,643 --> 00:32:17,143
Vています = fac / face (progresiv/ stare)
どんぶり = bol (bol pentru mâncare)

549
00:32:17,166 --> 00:32:20,242
Test de ascultare

550
00:32:20,242 --> 00:32:23,841
Pui sos de soia?

551
00:32:23,841 --> 00:32:28,786
N + を + V = marcator de obiect を
醤油(しょうゆ) = sos de soia

552
00:32:28,809 --> 00:32:32,443
Test de ascultare

553
00:32:32,443 --> 00:32:36,714
Da, puțin.

554
00:32:36,714 --> 00:32:42,580
数量詞(すうりょうし) + だけ = doar / numai
少(すこ)し (puțin) ↔ たくさん (mult)

555
00:32:42,603 --> 00:32:44,959
Test de ascultare

556
00:32:44,959 --> 00:32:47,659
Poftă bună!

557
00:32:47,659 --> 00:32:51,406
いただきます = expresie folosită înainte de a mânca

558
00:32:51,430 --> 00:32:54,799
Test de ascultare

559
00:32:54,799 --> 00:32:58,740
