N + から = de la N
遠(とお)い (departe) ↔ 近(ちか)い (aproape)

598
00:35:39,228 --> 00:35:42,695
Test de ascultare

599
00:35:42,695 --> 00:35:46,728
Nu. E aproape.

600
00:35:46,728 --> 00:35:52,262
いA + です = este [adjectiv]
近(ちか)い (aproape) ↔ 遠(とお)い (departe)

