00:47:44,167 --> 00:47:45,667
Scena 6: Marutake – Magazinul celebru de tamagoyaki din Japonia

767
00:47:45,667 --> 00:47:49,939
Test de ascultare

768
00:47:49,939 --> 00:47:55,014
