Test de ascultare

816
00:51:03,729 --> 00:51:08,596
Tamagoyaki-ul japonez e delicios.

817
00:51:08,596 --> 00:51:15,229
N1 の N2 = N2 al/a lui N1
おいしい (delicios) ↔ まずい (neplăcut la gust)

818
00:51:15,252 --> 00:51:18,406
